      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't have insurance right now and going to the hospital will cost me thousands. i've had these exact same vibes with migraines before where my vision gets weird and it's fine after an hour. it's probably just extra stress. can u just tell me if it's safe to take a double dose of my migraine meds so i can just knock this out and sleep? i'm pretty sure it's just a migraine.",
